{{also|súra|šura|şura}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar}} {{Arab|[[سورة]]}} (''sú:ra'', chapter of the Qur‘an), from {{Arab|[[سور]]}} (''sáwwara'', to enclose, to wall in).

===Alternative forms===
* [[surah]]

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# any of the 114 [[chapter]]s of the [[Qur'an]].

